{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51693","headline":"上亭驿（在梓潼武连二县之界。唐明皇幸蜀。闻铃声之地。又名琅璫驿） · 罗隐","name":"上亭驿（在梓潼武连二县之界。唐明皇幸蜀。闻铃声之地。又名琅璫驿）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山雨霏微宿上亭，雨中因想雨淋铃。\n贵爲天子犹魂断，穷着荷衣好涕零。\n（《舆地纪胜》一八六《隆庆府》。\n《全唐诗》六六五引《天中记》只存前二句）（〖1〗《碧鸡漫志》卷五收此诗全篇，爲七律，详《全唐诗续拾》卷四五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}